⦃
  ⧖:C,s,rev,name
  ⧗:C̵,s ○ ‹sigtypes› ⧖:C,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:name ⍆̵ ⧗:ins ⍆̵ ⧗:outs ⍆̵ ⧗:rev ⍆̵ ⧗:iev ⍆̵ ⧗:ich ⍆̵ ⧗:oev ⍆̵ ⧗:och ⍆̵ ⧗:f
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fninfo› ⸫

⍝ ‹pjoin› C L sep: print a list of strings joined by sep (0 a space, 1 ", ")
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,sep
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,L,sep ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,sep,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,sep,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,sep,j,n
        ⧗:sep ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $, $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
        ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ‹spr›
        ⧗:L,sep ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pjoin› ⸫

⍝ ‹sappj› C e L: append the strings of L joined by spaces
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,L
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,e,L ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,L,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,e,L,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,L,j,n
        ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:ee ⧗:ee #32# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
        ⧗:L,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C̵,e,x ‹sapp›
        ⧗:e,L ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sappj› ⸫

⍝ ‹cshape› C s: the call-by-shape key of signature node s (§9.1)
⦃
  ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C̵,s △ ‹sigtypes› ⧖:C,ins,outs,a,b,c,d
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e #10216# ‹scp› ⧗:e,ins ‹sappj› ⧗:e #32# ‹scp› ⧗:e #8888# ‹scp› ⧗:e #32# ‹scp›
  ⧗:e,outs ‹sappj› ⧗:e #10217# ‹scp› ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹cshape› ⸫

⍝ ---- popping operands and their case roles (§6)

⍝ ‹pwhat› C t mode: what an error names: 0 token t's text, 1 its label, 2 ⋔
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,mode
  ⧗:C̵,t,mode ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ptx› ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹plab› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ $⋔$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pwhat› ⸫

⍝ ‹pop› C S k tok wm: pop k values (deepest first) and order them by role
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,k,tok,wm
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S,k,tok,wm,n ⧗:n ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pop2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹poperr› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pop› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,S,k,tok,wm,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok,wm ‹pwhat› $ needs $ ⎙̵ ⧗:k ᛁ $ value(s) but the stack holds $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ᛁ ‹die›
  ⧗:S ⧗:S
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹poperr› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,S,k,tok,wm,n
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:n ⧗:k ⊟ ⧗:n ‹lslice› ⧖:C,vals
  ⧗:C̵,S ○ ⧗:n ⧗:k ⊟ ‹lslice› ⧖:C,S2
  ⍝ the slots, filled first by the marked values
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lbeg› ⧖:C,slots
  ⧗:C̵,slots ○ ⧗:k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,slots,i,k
    ⧗:C̵,slots,i,k ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,slots,i,k ⧗:C̵,slots #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:slots ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:k ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
  ⧗:vals,slots,k,tok,wm ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,slots,k,tok,wm,i
    ⧗:C̵,vals,slots,k,tok,wm,i ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹poprole› ⧖:i2 ⧗:i2 △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
  ⧗:vals,slots,k ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,slots,k,i
    ⧗:C̵,vals,slots,k,i ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹popfill› ⧖:i2 ⧗:i2 △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
  ⧗:S2,slots
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pop2› ⸫

⍝ ‹poprole› C vals slots k tok wm i: place a marked value
⦃
  ⧖:C,vals,slots,k,tok,wm,i
  ⧗:C̵,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C̵,slots,r ⧗:r ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lget› ⦄ ⦃ ‹lget› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⧖:C,cur
  ⧗:C̵,tok,wm,k ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:r ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ △ ‹roleerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:tok,wm,k ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:cur #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #2# ‹roleerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:slots,r,v ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lset› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:vals,slots,k,tok,wm,i
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹poprole› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,wm,k,code
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr›
  ⧗:tok,wm,k ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔
    ⦃ ⧖:tok,wm,k $impossible case role: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok,wm ‹pwhat› $ has only $ ⎙̵ ⧗:k ᛁ $ operand(s)$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:tok,wm,k $two operands of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok,wm ‹pwhat› $ carry the same case role$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹roleerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹popfill› C vals slots k i: an unmarked value takes the first free slot
⦃
  ⧖:C,vals,slots,k,i
  ⧗:C̵,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C̵,slots,v ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹freeslot› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:vals,slots,k,i
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹popfill› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,slots,v
  ⧗:C̵,slots ○
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:C,slots,j ⧗:C̵,slots,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C̵,slots ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:x #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊟ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⧖:j ⌁ ⧗:slots,j,v ‹lset›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹freeslot› ⸫

⍝ ‹unwrap› C t tok: ◌T used where T is expected: propagate (§7.3) when the function may fail
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,tok
