        ⧗:c △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #16# ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #8# ⋓ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,vals,i,n,want
  ⧗:C̵,tok #3# ‹tf› #25# ⋒ ⧖:C,have
  ⧗:C̵,tok,vals,want ⧗:have ⧗:want ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹disagree› ⦄ ⁼
