⍝ ---- operator rules (§18)

⍝ ‹operr› C tok i code wt got: "operand i+1 of X: expected WANT, found GOT"; WANT is
⍝ type wt for code 0, else: 1 ℤ, ℝ or 𝔹  2 ℤ or 𝔹  3 ℤ, ℝ, 𝔹 or ŧ  4 ŧ  5 ℤ, ℝ or ŧ
⍝ 6 a number  7 ʃ, ⟗ʃ or a number  8 ⟗⟦T⟧ or ⟗ʃ  9 ℤ  10 𝔹  11 ⟖⟦T⟧ or ⟖ʃ  12 𝔹 or ℤ  13 ⟦T⟧ or ʃ
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,i,code,wt,got
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $operand $ ⎙̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᛁ $ of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok ‹ptx› $: expected $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:wt ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹spr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ℤ, ℝ or 𝔹$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ℤ or 𝔹$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ℤ, ℝ, 𝔹 or ŧ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ŧ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ℤ, ℝ or ŧ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a number$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ʃ, ⟗ʃ or a number$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟗⟦T⟧ or ⟗ʃ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ℤ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $𝔹$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟖⟦T⟧ or ⟖ʃ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $𝔹 or ℤ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #13# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟦T⟧ or ʃ$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $, found $ ⎙̵ ⧗:got ‹spr› ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹operr› ⸫

⍝ ‹chk› C ok tok i code wt got: ‹operr› unless ok
⦃
  ⧖:C,ok,tok,i,code,wt,got
  ⧗:C̵,tok,i,code,wt,got ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹operr› ⦄ ⁼
