⍝ ‹cfail› C tok code: a fixed message at tok, and stop (codes in ‹pmsg›)
⦃ ⧖:C,tok,code ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:code ‹pmsg› ‹die› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cfail› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,ok,tok,code ⧗:C̵,tok,code ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cfail› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cfailunless› ⸫

⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $indexing an array of quantum values would clone one; not supported (§8.1)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $storing would drop the quantum element it replaces; not supported (§8.1)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $↯ fails, but this function's output is not ◌ (§7.3)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⊨ needs its predicate block directly before it: x ⦃pred⦄ ⊨$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $decoherence cap: a superposition holds at most 27 alternatives (§8.3)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $charge violation: ⫴ needs equal charges (§3.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $decoherence cap: lifting would make more than 27 alternatives (§8.3)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟖ needs exclusive access, but a shadow of this value is alive$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $this value already has a live ⟖ shadow$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $unreachable: nothing runs after ↯ in the same block$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a future-tense call cannot have outputs: it runs at the end of the block (§9.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a quoted block is only used directly before ⊨$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #13# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔ on a superposition (running every live face) is not supported in s1; collapse it first$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔⇋ needs a value for its exit assertion$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #15# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $charge violation: a value carried by ⥀ changes its charge on every iteration (§3.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #16# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $an array literal cannot fail$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $cannot infer the element type of an empty array ⟦ ⟧$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #18# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $an array cannot hold shadows (§8.2)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #19# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $this moment is consumed in some faces but not in others$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #20# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $an inferred ⁖ value cannot enter a reversible function: a collapse cannot be undone (§3.1)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #21# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $calls in a reversible function cannot be past or future tense$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #22# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔⇋ must follow its condition written as ⍿⁰ x ≶ with a literal x (s1, §10)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #23# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a particle is represented by a classical type$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #24# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a reversible function has effect ⟨S ⊸ S⟩ (§10)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #25# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $the entry point ᛟ has signature ⟨⊸⟩ or ⟨⊸ ◌⟩ (§9)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pmsg› ⸫

