  ⧗:C̵,tok,a,c ⧗:s ⋔ ⦃ ‹gt_store1› ⦄ ⦃ ‹gt_store2› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_store› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,a,c
  ⧗:C̵,c #13# ‹tis› ⧖:C,y ⧗:C̵,y,tok #2# #10# ○ ⧗:c ‹chk›
  #15# ‹reg› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_store1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,a,c
  ⧗:C̵,a #10198# #10214# ‹spfx2› ⧖:C,y ⧗:C̵,y,tok ○ #11# ○ ⧗:a ‹chk›
  ⧗:a #2# ‹elemof› ⧖:C,el
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:c ⧗:el ᛖ ⧗:tok #2# ○ ⧗:el,c ‹chk›
  ⧗:el ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp ⧗:C̵,cp,tok #2# ‹cfailunless›
  #15# ‹reg› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_store2› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,x,a,b,c
  ⧗:C̵,a #14# ‹tis› ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C̵,tok,a,b ⧗:s ⋔ ⦃ ‹gt_app1› ⦄ ⦃ ‹gt_app2› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_append› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,a,b
  ⍝ s1 extension: appending an integer stores its low byte
  ⧗:C̵,b #13# ‹tis› ⧖:C,y ⧗:C̵,b #11# ‹tis› ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:y ⧗:i ⋏ ⧗:tok △ #12# ○ ⧗:b ‹chk›
  #14# ‹reg› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_app1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,a,b
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹shead› ⧖:C,h ⧗:C̵ ⧗:h #10214# ᛖ ⧗:tok ○ #13# ○ ⧗:a ‹chk›
  ⧗:a △ ‹elemof› ⧖:C,el
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b ⧗:el ᛖ ⧗:tok △ ○ ⧗:el,b ‹chk›
  ⧗:a ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹gt_app2› ⸫

⍝ ‹arity› x: the operand count of glyph x, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:x
  #-1#
  ⧗:x ⧖ @any(8862,8863,8864,8856,8860,8822,8911,8910,8914,8915,10849,8810,8811,8982,9030)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:x ⧖ @any(8861,9863,8961,9076,9113,8872)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:x #9032# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹arity› ⸫

⍝ ---- linearity and borrows (§8)

⍝ ‹locks› C S strand locks: identities of values with a live shadow
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,strand,locks
  ⧗:C̵,locks ‹lcopy› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C̵,S,out ○ ‹addofs› ⧖:C,out2
  ⧗:C̵,strand,out2 △ ‹addofs›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹locks› ⸫
⍝ ‹addofs› C L out moments: out with the "of" of every value of L (of every non-void moment)
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,out,moments
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,L,out,moments ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,out,moments,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,out,moments,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,out,moments,j,n ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,of ⧗:C̵,v #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,x
        ⧗:C̵,out,of ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⧗:moments △ ᛖ ⧗:x △ ᛖ ⋎ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,out2
        ⧗:C̵,L,out2,moments ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:out ⌁ ⧗:out
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹addofs› ⸫

⍝ ‹moveok› C v live tok: moving v out is allowed (no live shadow of it)
⦃
  ⧖:C,v,live,tok
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,id
  ⧗:C̵,live,id ‹lhas› ⧖:C,locked
  ⧗:C̵,v,tok ⧗:cp ‹not› ⧗:locked ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹moveerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹moveok› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,v,tok
  ⧗:C̵,v #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vt
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $cannot move the $ ⎙̵ ⧗:v ‹vty› ‹spr› $ made at $ ⎙̵ ⧗:vt △ ‹tf› ᛁ $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:vt #2# ‹tf› ᛁ
  $ while it is entangled: a ⟗/⟖ shadow of it is still alive (§8.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹moveerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹push› C S outs tok depth: new values of types outs on S
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,outs,tok,depth
  ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S,outs,tok,depth ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,outs,tok,depth,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,S,outs,tok,depth,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,outs,tok,depth,j,n ⧗:C̵,outs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,tok,depth ‹vnew› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,S,v ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
        ⧗:C̵,S2,outs,tok,depth ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹push› ⸫

⍝ ‹annot1› C S n ev ch: set ev and ch on the top n values
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,n,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,len
  ⧗:C̵,S,ev,ch ⧗:len ⧗:n ⊟ ⧗:len
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,ev,ch,j,len
    ⧗:C̵,S,ev,ch,j,len ⧗:j ⧗:len ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,ev,ch,j,len ⧗:C̵,S,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,v #6# ⧗:ev ‹vset› ⧗:v #7# ⧗:ch ‹vset›
        ⧗:S,ev,ch ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:len ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹annot1› ⸫

⍝ ‹annotl› C S n evs chs: set ev and ch on the top n values from lists
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,n,evs,chs
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,len
  ⧗:C̵,S,evs,chs,n ○ ⧗:len ⧗:n ⊟
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,evs,chs,n,j,base
    ⧗:C̵,S,evs,chs,n,j,base ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,evs,chs,n,j,base ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:base ⧗:j ⊞ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,evs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,ev ⧗:C̵,chs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,ch
        ⧗:C̵,v #6# ⧗:ev ‹vset› ⧗:v #7# ⧗:ch ‹vset›
        ⧗:S,evs,chs,n ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:base ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹annotl› ⸫

⍝ ---- charges

⍝ ‹chsame› C a b: the common charge of a and b (a gluon takes the other), or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b
  ⧗:C̵,a #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,ga ⧗:C̵,b #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,gb
  ⧗:C̵ #-1# ⧗:a ⧗:a ⧗:b ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:a ⧗:gb ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:b ⧗:ga ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chsame› ⸫

⍝ ‹chcomb› C a b sign: product (sign 1) or quotient (sign −1) of charges; gluons count as neutral
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,sign
  ⧗:C̵,a #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,ga ⧗:C̵,b #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,gb
  ⧗:C̵,a,b,sign ⧗:ga ⧗:gb ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #17# ‹reg› ⦄ ⦃ ‹chcomb1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chcomb› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,sign
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹chvec› ⧖:C,a1,a2,a3,a4,a5,a6
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹chvec› ⧖:C,b1,b2,b3,b4,b5,b6
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a1 ⧗:b1 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a2 ⧗:b2 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a3 ⧗:b3 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞
  ⧗:a4 ⧗:b4 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a5 ⧗:b5 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a6 ⧗:b6 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ‹chfmt›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chcomb1› ⸫

⍝ ---- glyph operators: ‹glyph› C op S strand depth locks → C S strand

⍝ ⧖: bind the top of the stack as a moment
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,S △ ⧗:tok ○ ‹pop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C̵,vals ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,vtok,rg,of,role,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,tok,rg,of ○ ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,strand,m ‹lpush› ⧖:C,strand2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_bind› ⸫

⍝ ⧗ⁿ: read a moment
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ⧗:C̵,strand ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,idx,n ⧗:idx ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹readerr› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:C
  ⧗:n △ ⊟ ⧗:idx ⊟ ⧖:mi
  ⧗:C̵,strand,mi ‹lget› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ty,mtok ⧗:void △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹voiderr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⍝ a read agrees with the class of the moment's value, like an operator (§6.1)
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹l1› ⧖:C,vs ⧗:C̵,tok,vs ‹agree› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,ty ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,tok,depth,strand,mi,m ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ‹rd_copy› ⦄ ⦃ ‹rd_move› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v,strand2
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹trole› ⧖:C,role
  ⧗:C̵,v,role ⧗:role #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vrole› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v2
  ⧗:C̵,S,v2 ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_read› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,idx,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reads $ ⎙̵ ⧗:idx △ ⊞ ᛁ $ moment(s) back, but only $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ᛁ
  $ are visible here (data enters a block only through the stack, §5.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹readerr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,ty,mtok
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reads a void moment: its $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ty ‹spr› $ was already moved out (bound at $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:mtok △ ‹tf› ᛁ $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:mtok #2# ‹tf› ᛁ $)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹voiderr› ⸫

⍝ a copy of a shadow belongs to the region where the shadow was made
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,strand,mi,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:rg ⧗:depth ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:rg2
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg2 ‹vnew› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #4# ⧗:of ‹vset› ⧗:m,v ‹vannot›
  ⧗:v,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rd_copy› ⸫
⍝ quantum: move out, the moment becomes void
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,strand,mi,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,tok,rg,of #-1# ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,mtok,rg,of △ ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,m2
  ⧗:C̵,strand,mi,m2 ‹lset›
  ⧗:v,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rd_move› ⸫

⍝ ⍿ⁿ: pick (copy) or move from depth n
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,n ⧗:idx ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pickerr› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:C
  ⧗:n △ ⊟ ⧗:idx ⊟ ⧖:si
  ⧗:C̵,S,si ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,tok,depth,S,si,v ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ‹pk_copy› ⦄ ⦃ ‹pk_move› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,S2,w
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹trole› ⧖:C,role
  ⧗:C̵,w,role ⧗:role #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vrole› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,w2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,w2 ‹lpush› ⧗:strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_pick› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reaches below the stack (depth $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ᛁ $)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pickerr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,S,si,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,vtok,rg,of,role,ev,ch
  ⧗:rg ⧗:depth ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:rg2
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg2 ‹vnew› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵,w #4# ⧗:of ‹vset› ⧗:v,w ‹vannot›
  ⧗:S,w
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pk_copy› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,S,si,v
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S ○ ⧗:si ‹lslice› ⧖:C,A
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:si △ ⊞ ⧗:n ‹lslice› ⧖:C,B
  ⧗:C̵,A,B ‹lcat› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C̵,v #-1# ‹vrole› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵,S2,w
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pk_move› ⸫

⍝ ⟗ ⟖: entangle (shared or exclusive shadow)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tc0› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹enterr0› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:n △ ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tclass› ⧖:C,cl ⧗:C̵,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,tok,t ⧗:cl △ ᛖ ⧗:h #9676# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹enterr1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,id
  ⧗:C̵,live,id ‹lhas› ⧖:C,locked
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:x #10198# ᛖ ⧗:locked ⋎ ‹not› ⧗:tok #8# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:S,id,tok ‹excl› 
