  ⍿⁰ #10199# ᛖ ⍿¹ #10198# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹g_entangle› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8623# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹g_fail› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8872# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹g_attest› ⦄ ⦃
  ⧖ @any(10996,8859,8857)@ ⋔ ⦃ ‹g_psi› ⦄ ⦃ ‹g_op› ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹glyph› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ‹reg› ⧖:C,cf
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:cf △ ᛖ ⧗:tok #3# ‹cfailunless› ⧗:S,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_fail› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹cfail› ⧗:S,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_attest› ⸫

⍝ ---- block results [S strand dead], leaks and escapes

⦃ ⧖:C,S,strand,dead ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ⧗:S ⍆̵ ⧗:strand ⍆̵ ⧗:dead ⍆̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rnew› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵,r ‹rd› ⧖:C,S ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,st ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C̵,S,st,d ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rget› ⸫

⍝ ‹noleak› C strand from: moments that evaporate must not hold quantum values (§8.1)
⦃
  ⧖:C,strand,from
  ⧗:C̵,strand ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,strand,from,n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,strand,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,strand,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,strand,j,n ⧗:C̵,strand,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,m
        ⧗:C̵,m #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,void ⧗:C̵,m ‹vty› ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
        ⧗:C̵,m ⧗:void ○ ᛖ ⧗:cp ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹leakerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:strand ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹noleak› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,m #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹cerr› $decoherence leak: the $ ⎙̵ ⧗:m ‹vty› ‹spr› $ bound here is never consumed (move it, ⌁ it, or return it; §8.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹leakerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹noescape› C vs depth: shadows created in this block (region ≥ depth) may not leave it (§8.2)
⦃
  ⧖:C,vs,depth
  ⧗:C̵,vs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,vs,depth ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vs,depth,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,vs,depth,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,vs,depth,j,n ⧗:C̵,vs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,of ⧗:C̵,v #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,rg
        ⧗:C̵,v ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:rg ⧗:depth ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹escerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:vs,depth ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹noescape› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹cerr› $the shadow $ ⎙̵ ⧗:v ‹vty› ‹spr› $ created here escapes its block (§8.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹escerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹pwcode› code: what a join or predicate error names
⦃
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⁇$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $the ⊨ predicate$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $the ⋔⇋ exit assertion$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $a prayer$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $the ⟜ predicate$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pwcode› ⸫

⍝ ---- joins (§5.1 rule 3, §7.1)

⍝ ‹livers› C rs: the results that are not dead
⦃
  ⧖:C,rs
  ⧗:C̵,rs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵,rs,live ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,rs,live,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,rs,live,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,rs,live,j,n ⧗:C̵,rs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r #2# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,d
        ⧗:C̵,live,r ⧗:d ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,live2
        ⧗:C̵,rs,live2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:live ⌁ ⧗:live
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹livers› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,rs,tok,what,depth
  ⧗:C̵,rs ‹livers› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵,live ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e,e △ ⦄ ⦃ ‹join1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹join› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n
  ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,n ‹jtypes›
  ⧗:live,tok,what,depth,n ‹jstack› ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C̵,live,n ‹jprefix› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C̵,live,n,p ‹jstrand› ⧖:C,strand
  ⧗:C̵,live,n,p ‹jleaks›
  ⧗:strand ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ‹noescape›
  ⧗:S,strand ○
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹join1› ⸫

⍝ ‹rstack› C live i: the stack of live result i; ‹rstrand› its strand
⦃ ⧖:C,live,i ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹lget› ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rstack› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,live,i ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rstrand› ⸫

⍝ ‹jtypes› C live tok what n: every live face leaves the same types
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,n
  ⧗:C̵,live ○ ‹rstack› ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,t0
  ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,t0 △ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,tok,what,t0,i,n
    ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,t0,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,tok,what,t0,i,n ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstack› ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,ti
        ⧗:C̵,ti,t0 ‹leq› ⧖:C,same
        ⧗:C̵,tok,what,t0,ti ⧗:same ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹jdiff› ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:live,tok,what,t0 ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹jtypes› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,what,t0,ti
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:what ‹pwcode› $ leaves different stacks: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:t0 ○ ‹plist› $ and $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ti ○ ‹plist›
  $ (every live face must have the same effect)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹jdiff› ⸫

⍝ ‹jstack› C live tok what depth n: the merged stack; values unchanged in every face keep their identity
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n
  ⧗:C̵,live ○ ‹rstack› ⧖:C,S0
  ⧗:C̵,S0 ‹llen› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S ○ ⧗:m
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S,j,m
    ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S,j,m ⧗:j ⧗:m ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S,j,m
        ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,j ‹jslot› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,S,v ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
        ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:m ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,S,j,m ⧗:C̵,S
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹jstack› ⸫

⍝ ‹jslot› C live tok what depth n S0 j: the merged value at slot j
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n,S0,j
  ⧗:C̵,S0,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v0
  ⧗:C̵,v0 △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,id0
  ⍝ same identity in every face?  and the deepest region of the shadows
  ⧗:C̵,v0 #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,rg0
  ⧗:C̵,live,j,id0 △ ⧗:n ⦶ ⧗:rg0
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,j,id0,i,n,same,rg
    ⧗:C̵,live,j,id0,i,n,same,rg ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,j,id0,i,n,same,rg ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstack› ⧖:C,Si ⧗:C̵,Si,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,vi
        ⧗:C̵,vi △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,idi ⧗:C̵,vi #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ri
        ⧗:C̵,live,j,id0 ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:same ⧗:idi ⧗:id0 ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:rg ⧗:ri ‹max› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,live,j,id0,i,n,same,rg
  ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,depth,n,j,v0,rg ⧗:same ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:v ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:v ⦄ ⦃ ‹jnew› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹jslot› ⸫

⍝ ‹jnew› C live tok what depth n j v0 rg: a new value for a slot the faces disagree on
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,depth,n,j,v0,rg
  ⧗:C̵,v0 ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,vtok,vrg,of,role,ev,ch
  ⧗:depth ⧗:rg ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:rg2
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg2 ‹vnew› ⧖:C,nv
  ⧗:C̵,nv #4# ⧗:of ‹vset›
  ⧗:live,tok,what,j,v0,ev,ch △ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,tok,what,j,v0,ev,ch,i,n
    ⧗:C̵,live,tok,what,j,v0,ev,ch,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,tok,what,j,v0,ev,ch,i,n ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstack› ⧖:C,Si ⧗:C̵,Si,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,vi
        ⧗:C̵,vi #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,evi ⧗:C̵,vi #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,chi
        ⧗:C̵,ch,chi ‹chsame› ⧖:C,ch2
        ⧗:C̵,tok,what,v0,vi ⧗:ch2 #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹jcharge› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:live,tok,what,j,v0 ⧗:ev ⧗:evi ‹evmax› ⧗:ch2 ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,live,tok,what,j,v0,ev,ch,i,n
  ⧗:C̵,nv #6# ⧗:ev ‹vset› ⧗:nv #7# ⧗:ch ‹vset›
  ⧗:nv
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹jnew› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,what,v0,vi
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $charge violation: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:what ‹pwcode› $ joins $ ⎙̵ ⧗:v0 ‹pvstr› $ with $ ⎙̵ ⧗:vi ‹pvstr› $ (§3.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹jcharge› ⸫

⍝ ‹jprefix› C live n: the longest common prefix of the faces' moment types
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,n
  ⧗:C̵,live ○ ‹rstrand› ⧖:C,st0
  ⧗:C̵,st0 ‹llen› ⧖:C,p
  ⧗:C̵,live,st0 △ ⧗:n ⧗:p
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,st0,i,n,p
    ⧗:C̵,live,st0,i,n,p ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,st0,i,n,p ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstrand› ⧖:C,si ⧗:C̵,st0,si,p ‹cprefix› ⧖:C,p2 ⧗:C̵,live,st0 ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:p2 ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,live,st0,i,n,p ⧗:C̵,p
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹jprefix› ⸫
⍝ ‹cprefix› C a b p: how many of the first p moments of a and b have equal types
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,p
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹llen› ⧖:C,nb
  ⧗:C̵,a,b ○ ⧗:p ⧗:nb ‹min›
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,a,b,q,lim
    ⧗:C̵,a,b,q,lim ⧗:q ⧗:lim ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,a,b,q,lim ⧗:C̵,a,q ‹lget› ‹vty› ⧖:C,ta ⧗:C̵,b,q ‹lget› ‹vty› ⧖:C,tb
        ⧗:C̵,a,b,q,lim ⧗:ta ⧗:tb ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:l △ ⊞ ⧗:l ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,a,b,q,lim ⧗:C̵,q
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹cprefix› ⸫

⍝ ‹jstrand› C live n p: the exported moments (consumed in all faces or in none)
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,n,p
  ⧗:C̵,live ○ ‹rstrand› ⧖:C,st0
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C̵,live,n,st0,out ○ ⧗:p
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,n,st0,out,q,p
    ⧗:C̵,live,n,st0,out,q,p ⧗:q ⧗:p ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,n,st0,out,q,p ⧗:C̵,st0,q ‹lget› ⧖:C,m0
        ⧗:C̵,live,n,q,m0 ‹jvoid›
        ⧗:out,m0 ‹lpush› ⧖:C,out2
        ⧗:C̵,live,n,st0,out2 ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:p ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,live,n,st0,out,q,p ⧗:C̵,out
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹jstrand› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,live,n,q,m0
  ⧗:C̵,m0 #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,v0 ⧗:C̵,m0 #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,mt
  ⧗:C̵,live,q,v0,mt ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,q,v0,mt,i,n
    ⧗:C̵,live,q,v0,mt,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,q,v0,mt,i,n ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstrand› ⧖:C,si ⧗:C̵,si,q ‹lget› #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vi
        ⧗:C̵ ⧗:vi ⧗:v0 ᛖ ⧗:mt #19# ‹cfailunless›
        ⧗:live,q,v0,mt ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹jvoid› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,live,n,p
  ⧗:C̵,live,p ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,live,p,i,n
    ⧗:C̵,live,p,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,live,p,i,n ⧗:C̵,live,i ‹rstrand› ⧖:C,si ⧗:C̵,si,p ‹noleak› ⧗:live,p ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹jleaks› ⸫

⍝ ---- nested blocks

⍝ ‹brange› C b: the ops of block node b, as slots from … to−1
⦃ ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵,b #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz ⧗:C̵ ⧗:b #3# ⊞ ⧗:b ⧗:sz ⊞ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹brange› ⸫

⍝ ‹sub› C from to S depth locks ind: run a nested block; a shadow it made may not escape on the stack
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,S,depth,locks,ind
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,S ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ⧗:locks,ind ‹cblock› ⧖:C,S2,strand,dead
  ⧗:C̵,S2 ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ⧗:dead ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹noescape› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:S2,strand,dead
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹sub› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,S,depth,locks,ind
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,S,depth,locks,ind ‹sub›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹subb› ⸫

⍝ ‹predicate› C b vals tok what depth locks ind: a predicate block (⍤, ⊨, ⋔⇋, ⟜) sees copies or
⍝ shadows of vals and must leave exactly one ŧ
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,vals,tok,what,depth,locks,ind
  ⧗:C̵,vals ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,PS
  ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n ⧗:C̵,vals,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
        ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
        ⧗:C̵,v,t,tok,depth ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹pshadow› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,w
        ⧗:C̵,PS,w ‹lpush› ⧖:C,PS2
        ⧗:C̵,vals,tok,depth,PS2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,vals,tok,depth,PS,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,PS ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ⧗:locks,ind ‹cblock› ⧖:C,S2,strand,dead
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand,tok,what ⧗:dead ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹predcheck› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹predicate› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,v,t,tok,depth
  #10199# ⧗:t ⧖:a,b ⧗:C̵,a,b ‹spre› ⧖:C,sht
  ⧗:C̵,sht,tok ⧗:depth △ ⊞ ‹vnew› ⧖:C,sh
  ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,id
  ⧗:C̵,sh #4# ⧗:id ‹vset› ⧗:sh
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pshadow› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S2,strand,tok,what
  ⧗:C̵,S2 ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,ts
  ⧗:C̵ #10# ‹reg› ‹l1› ⧖:C,want
  ⧗:C̵,ts,want ‹leq› ⧖:C,ok
  ⧗:C̵,tok,what,ts ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,wh,ts2 ⧗:tk ‹cerr› ⧗:wh ‹pwcode› $ must leave exactly [ŧ], but leaves $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ts2 ○ ‹plist› ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:strand ○ ‹noleak›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹predcheck› ⸫

⍝ ---- calls

⍝ ‹apply› C S strand locks f tok depth: call a function with record f
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,strand,locks,f,tok,depth
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹llen› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,S,k,tok △ ‹pop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵,vals,live,f,tok ○ ⧗:k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,vals,live,f,tok,i,k
    ⧗:C̵,vals,live,f,tok,i,k ⧗:i ⧗:k ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹apply1› ⧖:i2,k2 ⧗:i2 △ ⊞ ⧗:k2 ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,S2,outs,tok,depth ‹push› ⧖:C,S3
  ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵,f #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,oev ⧗:C̵,f #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,och
  ⧗:C̵,S3,no,oev,och ‹annotl›
  ⧗:S3
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹apply› ⸫

⍝ ‹apply1› C vals live f tok i k: check argument i
⦃
  ⧖:C,vals,live,f,tok,i,k
  ⧗:C̵,vals,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C̵,ins,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,want
  ⧗:C̵,t,tok ⧗:t ⧗:want ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹unwrap› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,t2
  ⧗:C̵,tok,i,want,t2 ⧗:t2 ⧗:want ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹argerr› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,v #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,have
  ⧗:C̵,f #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,iev ⧗:C̵,iev,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,wev
  ⧗:C̵,tok,i,have,wev ⧗:have ⧗:wev ‹evok› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹argev› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,rev
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:rev △ ᛖ ⧗:have △ ᛖ ⋎ ‹not› ⧗:tok #20# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ich ⧗:C̵,ich,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,wch
  ⧗:C̵,v #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vch
  ⧗:C̵,vch,wch ‹chsame› ⧖:C,cs
  ⧗:C̵,tok,i,v,wch ⧗:cs #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹argch› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:v,live,tok ‹moveok›
  ⧗:vals,live,f,tok,i,k
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹apply1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,i,want,t
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $argument $ ⎙̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᛁ $ of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok ‹plab› $: expected $ ⎙̵ ⧗:want ‹spr› $, found $ ⎙̵ ⧗:t ‹spr› ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹argerr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,i,have,wev
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $argument $ ⎙̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᛁ $ of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:have ‹evname› $, but the parameter accepts only $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:wev ‹evname› $ values; attest it with ⊨ or mark the parameter (§3.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹argev› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,i,v,wch
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $charge violation: argument $ ⎙̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ᛁ $ of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:v ‹pvstr›
  $, the parameter wants charge ⁽$ ⎙̵ ⧗:wch ‹spr› $⁾ (§3.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹argch› ⸫

⍝ ‹fnfind› C name: the function record of that name, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵ #7# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fns
  ⧗:C̵,fns ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,fns,name ○ ⧗:n #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,fns,name,j,n,found
    ⧗:C̵,fns,name,j,n,found ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,fns,name,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,fns,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,fname
        ⧗:C̵,fns,name ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:found ⧗:f ⧗:fname ⧗:name ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,fns,name,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fnfind› ⸫

⍝ ‹resolve› C op: the function a call node names (§9, §9.1)
⦃
  ⧖:C,op
  ⧗:C̵,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,op,tok,k ⧗:k #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹resshape› ⦄ ⦃ ‹resname› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹resolve› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,tok,k
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tname› ⧖:C,nm
  ⧗:C̵,nm ‹fnfind› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,tok,nm ⧗:f #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:tk,n ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $unknown function $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ‹spr› ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,rev
  ⧗:C̵,tok,nm ⧗:k #4# ᛖ ⧗:rev ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:tk,n ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $⇜$ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ‹spr› $ calls an inverse, but $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ‹spr› $ is not reversible (⇋, §10)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:f
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹resname› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,tok
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ‹cshape› ⧖:C,key
  ⧗:C̵ #9# ‹reg› ⧖:C,shapes
  ⍝ the names with that shape, in definition order
  ⧗:C̵,shapes ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,names
  ⧗:C̵,shapes,key,names ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,shapes,key,names,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,shapes,key,names,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,shapes,key,names,j,n ⧗:C̵,shapes,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,ek ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,en
        ⧗:C̵,names,en ⧗:ek ⧗:key ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,names2
        ⧗:C̵,shapes,key,names2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,shapes,key,names,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,names ‹llen› ⧖:C,nn
  ⧗:C̵,tok,key,names ⧗:nn ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:tk,ky ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $no function has the shape $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ky ‹spr› ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,tok,key,names ⧗:nn △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,ky,ns ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $shape collision: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ky ‹spr› $ is the shape of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ns △ ‹pjoin› ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,names ○ ‹lget› ‹fnfind›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹resshape› ⸫

⍝ ---- block cases: C op S strand dead depth locks ind prev → C S strand dead skip lab larg
