  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tkd› ⧖:C,lk
  #11# ⧗:lk #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #12# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:lk #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:lk #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #14# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:r
