⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev,to
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹resolve› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,tok #2# ‹tmark› ⧖:C,fut
