⍝ ⋔ and ⋔⇋
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev,to
  ⧗:C̵,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,S △ ⧗:tok #2# ‹pop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C̵,vals ○ ‹lget› ‹vty› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,tok ‹unwrap› ⧖:C,ct
  ⧗:C̵,ct ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:h #968# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:tok #13# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:ct #10# ‹tis› ⧖:C,istrit
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ct ⧗:istrit ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,c ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $⋔ selects on a trit ŧ, found $ ⎙̵ ⧗:c ‹spr› ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:S2,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,inner
  ⍝ the three faces
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,rs
  ⧗:C̵,op ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ⧗:S2,depth,inner,ind,rs ○ #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,op,c,S,depth,inner,ind,rs,fi,prevr
    ⧗:C̵,op,c,S,depth,inner,ind,rs,fi,prevr ⧗:fi #3# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹selface› ⊕ ⦄
