  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,ind,S,larg ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,ind,S,larg ⧗:ind ‹pind› $shape-call → $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,larg ‹spr› ⧗:S ‹trtail› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹trshape› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,ind,tok,S,lab,larg ⧗:C̵,ind,lab,S ‹tracek› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹trfix› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,S,depth,locks,ind
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,strand
  ⍝ the loop carries [C oi to S strand dead depth locks ind prev]
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,S,strand ○ ⧗:depth,locks,ind #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev
    ⧗:C̵,oi,to,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev ⧗:oi ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹bstep› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,oi,to,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev
  ⧗:C̵,S,strand,dead
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cblock› ⸫

⍝ ‹bstep› C oi to S strand dead depth locks ind prev: one op of a block
