  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:dead ○ ᛖ ⧗:tok #10# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:oi,S,strand,dead,depth,locks,ind,prev,to ‹case› ⧖:C,S2,strand2,dead2,skip,lab,larg
  ⧗:C̵,ind,tok,lab,larg,S2 ‹btrace› ⧖:C
