  ⧗:oi ⧗:nx ⧗:skip △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:prev2
  ⧗:oi2,to,S2,strand2,dead2,depth,locks,ind,prev2
