  ⧗:C̵,i ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,i ‹nextn› ⧖:C,n1 ⧗:C̵,n1 ‹nextn› ⧖:C,n2 ⧗:C̵,n2 ‹nextn› ⧖:C,n3
  ⧗:C̵,i,to,k,n1,n2,n3 ‹rvcode› ⧖:C,code
  ⧗:C̵,i,to,k,tok,n1,n2,n3,code
