  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:n3 #3# ⊞ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,c,q
    ⧗:C̵,c ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,fk
    ⧗:C̵,c ⧗:fk #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:cc ⧗:cc ‹brange› ‹reversible› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:c ‹nextn› ⧖:C,c2
    ⧗:C̵,c2 ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:q △ ⊞ #3# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
  ⧗:n3 ‹nextn› ⧗:to
