⦃
  ⧖:C,i,to,k,tok,n1,n2,n3
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:tok #22# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab›
  $ is not invertible here: a reversible function may use x ⊞, x ⊟, x ⩡ (x a literal or ⍿ⁿ with n ≥ 1), ⊝, ⇋ calls and ⋔⇋ (§10)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
  ⧗:to,to
