⍝ ---- functions

⍝ ‹tbase› C t: strip ◌ ⟗ ⟖ ψₙ and ⟦…⟧ to find the base type name
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,b
    ⧗:C̵,b ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
    ○ ⧗:h ⧖ @any(9676,10199,10198)@ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:h #968# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:h #10214# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:code
    ⧗:C̵,b,code ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹stail› ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹psiinner› ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ‹elemof› ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tbase› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptfind› C name: the representation of particle name, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵ #8# ‹reg› ⧖:C,ps
  ⧗:C̵,ps ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ps,name ○ ⧗:n #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ps,name,j,n,found
    ⧗:C̵,ps,name,j,n,found ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ps,name,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,ps,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e ‹rd› ⧖:C,en ⧗:C̵ ⧗:e △ ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,rep
        ⧗:C̵,ps,name ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:found ⧗:rep ⧗:en ⧗:name ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,ps,name,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,found
