⍝ ‹chktypes› C ts tok outputs: every named type is a declared particle; shadows cannot be returned
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts,tok,outputs
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts,tok,outputs ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ts,tok,outputs,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,ts,tok,outputs,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ts,tok,outputs,j,n ⧗:C̵,ts,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,tok,outputs ‹chktype1› ⧗:ts,tok,outputs ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹chktypes› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,tok,outputs
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tbase› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹slen› ⧖:C,bl ⧗:C̵,b ‹shead› ⧖:C,bh
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹ptfind› ⧖:C,rep
  ⧗:C̵,tok,b ⧗:bl ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:bh ‹isbasecp› ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:rep #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,bb ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $unknown type $ ⎙̵ ⧗:bb ‹spr› $ (Ogham type names must be declared with ⚛, §8.6)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,tok,t ⧗:outputs △ ᛖ ⧗:h #10199# ᛖ ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋏ ⋎ ⋔
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,tt ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $a function cannot return a shadow $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tt ‹spr› $ (shadows never leave their block, §8.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹chktype1› ⸫

⍝ ‹fparams› C f name tok: the starting stack (inside its own antiparticle a particle decays to its representation, §8.6)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,name,tok
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins
  ⧗:C̵,name ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,name ‹stail› ⧖:C,pt
  ⧗:C̵,pt ‹ptfind› ⧖:C,rep
  ⧗:h #8961# ᛖ ⧗:rep #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧖:anti
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C̵,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S ○ ⧗:n ⧗:anti
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S,j,n,anti
    ⧗:C̵,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S,j,n,anti ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹fparam1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S,j,n,anti ⧗:C̵,S
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fparams› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S,j,n,anti
  ⧗:C̵,ins,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:t ⧗:rep ⧗:anti ⧗:t ⧗:pt ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:t2
  ⧗:C̵,t2,tok ○ ‹vnew› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,t2 ‹tclass› ⧖:C,cl
  ⧗:C̵,v #4# ○ ⧗:cl △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹vset› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:f #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,iev ⧗:C̵,iev,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,ev
  ⧗:C̵,f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ich ⧗:C̵,ich,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,v #6# ⧗:ev ‹vset› ⧗:v #7# ⧗:ch ‹vset›
  ⧗:S,v ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C̵,f,ins,tok,pt,rep,S2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n,anti
