⍝ ‹cfunction› C it f: check function item it with record f
⦃
  ⧖:C,it,f
  ⧗:C̵,it ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵,outs ○ ‹lget› ‹shead› ⧖:C,oh
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ⧗:no △ ᛖ ⧗:oh #9676# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ‹wr›
  ⧗:f,name,tok ‹fparams› ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C̵,it #5# ‹nd› ⧖:C,nfr
  ⧗:it #6# ⊞ ⧗:nfr ⊞ ⧖:sig
  ⍝ the header line
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,name,sig,S ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,name,sig,S ⧗:C̵,sig ‹cshape› ⧖:C,key $fn $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,name ‹spr› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:key ‹spr› $  start $ ⎙̵ ⧗:S △ ‹plist› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,sig #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,ssz
  ⧗:C̵,it #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,isz
  ⧗:sig ⧗:ssz ⊞ ⧖:from
  ⧗:it ⧗:isz ⊞ ⧖:to
  ⧗:C̵,it #4# ‹nd› ⧖:C,rev
  ⧗:C̵,from,to ⧗:rev △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹reversible› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,S △ ⧗:e △ ‹cblock› ⧖:C,R,rst,rdead
  ⧗:C̵,f,tok,name,R ⧗:rdead ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹fnend› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:rst ○ ‹noleak›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cfunction› ⸫

⍝ ‹fnend› C f tok name R: the final stack must be what the signature promises
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok,name,R
  ⧗:C̵,R ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,got
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,got,outs ‹leq› ⧖:C,same
  ⧗:C̵ #2# ‹reg› ⧖:C,cf
  ⧗:C̵,outs ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,o
  ⧗:C̵,got ‹llen› ⧖:C,ng
  ⧗:C̵,got ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,g0
  ⧗:C̵ #9676# ⧗:g0 ‹spre› ⧖:C,wrapped
  ⧗:C̵,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare
  ⧗:same ⧗:cf △ ᛖ ⧗:bare ⧗:ng ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:ng △ ᛖ ⧗:wrapped ⧗:o ᛖ ⋎ ⋏ ⋎ ⋏ ⧖:ok
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,got,outs ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,nm,g,os ⧗:tk ‹cerr› ⧗:nm ‹spr› $ ends with $ ⎙̵ ⧗:g ○ ‹plist› $ but its signature promises $ ⎙̵ ⧗:os ○ ‹plist› ‹die› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,R ‹llen› ⧖:C,nr
  ⧗:C̵,f,tok,name,R ○ ⧗:nr
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,tok,name,R,j,nr
    ⧗:C̵,f,tok,name,R,j,nr ⧗:j ⧗:nr ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹fnout1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹fnend› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok,name,R,j,nr
  ⧗:C̵,R,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,have
  ⧗:C̵,f #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,oev ⧗:C̵,oev,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,wev
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,have ⧗:have ⧗:wev ‹evok› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,nm,hv ⧗:tk ‹cerr› ⧗:nm ‹spr› $ returns a value that is $ ⎙̵ ⧗:hv ‹evname›
      $; declare the output ⸮ (or ⁖), or attest the value with ⊨ (§3.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:f #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,och ⧗:C̵,och,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,wch
  ⧗:C̵,v #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vch
  ⧗:C̵,vch,wch ‹chsame› ⧖:C,cs
  ⧗:C̵,tok,name,v,wch ⧗:cs #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,nm,vv,wc ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $charge violation: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:nm ‹spr› $ returns $ ⎙̵ ⧗:vv ‹pvstr› $ but promises charge ⁽$ ⎙̵ ⧗:wc ‹spr› $⁾ (§3.2)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:f,tok,name,R ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:nr
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹fnout1› ⸫

⍝ ---- entry: register particles and functions, then check every function

⍝ ‹items› C pass: run pass 1 (particles), 2 (signatures) or 3 (bodies) over the tangled items
⦃
  ⧖:C,pass
  ⧗:C̵ #24# ‹reg› ⧖:C,from ⧗:C̵ #25# ‹reg› ⧖:C,to
  ⧗:C̵,from,to,pass
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i,to,pass
    ⧗:C̵,i,to,pass ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,i,to,pass ⧗:C̵,i,pass ‹item1› ⧗:i ‹nextn› ⧖:C,i2 ⧗:C̵,i2,to,pass ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹citems› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,pass
  ⧗:C̵,i ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,i,k,pass ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pass1› ⦄ ⦃ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pass2› ⦄ ⦃ ‹pass3› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹item1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,i,k
  ⧗:C̵,i,k ⧗:k #31# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pass1p› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:i #4# ⊞ ○ ‹canon› ⧖:C,rep
  ⧗:C̵,rep ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,i ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,cp,tok #23# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:i #3# ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,nt ⧗:C̵,nt ‹tname› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:name ⍆̵ ⧗:rep ⍆̵ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #8# ‹reg› ⧖:C,ps ⧗:C̵,ps,e ‹lpush› ⧖:C,ps2 ⧗:C̵ #8# ⧗:ps2 ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass1p› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,i,k
  ⧗:C̵,i,k ⧗:k #31# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹pass2f› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,k
  ⧗:C̵,i ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,i #4# ‹nd› ⧖:C,r4
  ⧗:C̵,i #5# ‹nd› ⧖:C,nfr
  ⧗:k #40# ᛖ ⧗:r4 △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧖:rev
  ⧗:i #6# ⊞ ⧗:nfr ⊞ ⧗:i #5# ⊞ ⧗:k #40# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:sig
  ⧗:C̵,i #3# ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,nt ⧗:C̵,nt ‹tname› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,sig ⧗:rev ⋔ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:name ‹fninfo› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,ins,tok ○ ‹chktypes› ⧗:outs,tok △ ‹chktypes› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #7# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fns ⧗:C̵,fns,f ‹lpush› ⧖:C,fns2 ⧗:C̵ #7# ⧗:fns2 ‹wr›
  ⧗:sig ‹cshape› ⧖:C,key
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ ⧗:key ⍆̵ ⧗:name ⍆̵ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #9# ‹reg› ⧖:C,sh ⧗:C̵,sh,e ‹lpush› ⧖:C,sh2 ⧗:C̵ #9# ⧗:sh2 ‹wr›
  ⧗:ins,outs ‹leq› ⧖:C,io
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:rev ‹not› ⧗:io ⋏ ⧗:tok #24# ‹cfailunless›
  #5855# ‹str1› ⧖:C,entry
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹llen› ⧖:C,ni
  ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵,outs ○ ‹lget› #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,obare
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:name ⧗:entry ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:ni ○ ᛖ ⧗:no ○ ᛖ ⧗:no △ ᛖ ⧗:obare ⋎ ⋏ ⋎ ⋏ ⧗:tok #25# ‹cfailunless›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass2f› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,i,k
  ⧗:C̵,i,k ⧗:k #40# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹pass3f› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass3› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵,i #3# ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,nt ⧗:C̵,nt ‹tname› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,name ‹fnfind› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵,i,f ‹cfunction›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pass3f› ⸫

⍝ ‹cinit› T F st trace: the heap for checking: registers, the common types, the token buffer and the tree
⦃
  ⧖:T,F,st,trace
  ⟦ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ⟧
  ‹snew› △ ⧗:trace ‹wr›
  ‹len› ⧖:C,tb ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpyin› #4# ⧗:tb ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:C̵ ‹ccopyst› ⧖:st2,C
  ⧗:st2̵ ⌁̵
  ⍝ the path, as a string
  ⧗:F̱ ᛞ ⧖:pc
  ⧗:pc̵ ⟗ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpath› ⧖:C ⌁̵
  ⧗:C̵ #359# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #10# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #8484# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #11# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #8477# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #12# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #120121# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #13# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #643# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #14# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #9676# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #15# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  ‹sbeg› ‹send› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #16# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #42# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #17# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #10199# #643# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #18# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #10198# #643# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #19# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #9676# #120121# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #20# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ #7# ⧗:e ‹wr› #8# ⧗:e ‹wr› #9# ⧗:e ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cinit› ⸫

⍝ ‹ccopyst› st C: copy the tree into the heap (register 5: its base; 24, 25: the tangled items)
⦃
  ⧖:st,C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,ab
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpyin› #5# ⧗:ab ‹wr› #24# ⧗:sṯ #2# ᚳ ‹wr› #25# ⧗:sṯ ᚴ ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ccopyst› ⸫

⍝ ‹cpath› pc C: the path's code points as an interned string in register 6
⦃
  ⧖:pc,C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e ○ ⧗:pc̱ ᚴ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n
    ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n ⧗:pc̱ ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:pc̱,j ᚳ ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:e ⧖:C ⌁̱ ⧗:C̵,e ‹send› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #6# ⧗:s ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cpath› ⸫

⍝ ‹check› C: check every item (its trace goes to the output when register 1 is set)
⦃ △ ‹citems› #2# ‹citems› #3# ‹citems› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹check› ⸫
